							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 616,
							"top": 640,
							"width": 297,
							"height": 85,
							"text": "2. EventLoop本质上就是事件循环，所以我们\n将这个执行流程封装到loop函数中\n3. 在loop函数执行的过程中，每一次执行时都有\n循环执行体，我们将循环执行体也封装在一个\n函数中waitEpollFd()"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZDZmpwqO+B0o=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDZmpmKOXpbM="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDY0HcIEfXHc="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "766:617;765:639"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZDZvfT66rfvY=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 608,
							"top": 736,
							"width": 377,
							"height": 50,
							"text": "4.在waitEpollFd内部，首先要调用epoll_wait函数，\n之后主要执行的就是新连接的处理和已经建立好的连接的处理\n"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZDZvfea7S318=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDZvfT66rfvY="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDY0HcIEfXHc="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "786:617;794:735"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZDZy5h7Wa+W8=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 616,
							"top": 816,
							"width": 377,
							"height": 50,
							"text": "5. 新连接的处理封装到一个函数handleNewConnection中\n6. 已经建立好的连接的处理封装到函数handleMesssage中"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZDZy5tLXBeHQ=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDZy5h7Wa+W8="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDY0HcIEfXHc="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "788:617;802:815"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZDZ+VL8RPX5A=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 936,
							"top": 648,
							"width": 129,
							"height": 25,
							"text": "思想：代码即注释"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZDZ+VYMR2ogg=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDZ+VL8RPX5A="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDY0HcIEfXHc="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "892:544;988:647"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZDa23oc1atyY=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 336,
							"top": 728,
							"width": 241,
							"height": 115,
							"text": "3. 网络编程过程中，\n对于一个连接而言，\n一定会发生3个半事件：\na. 当连接建立时，执行回调函数\nb. 当消息到达时，执行回调函数\nc. 当连接断开时，执行回调函数\nd. 当消息发送完成时"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZDa23zM2B83E=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDa23oc1atyY="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZCDWACGFrjZc="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "464:606;459:727"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZElz7m5EIKhk=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 288,
							"top": 856,
							"width": 329,
							"height": 98,
							"text": "4. 回调函数的函数类型应该是什么样的？\n返回值可以直接设置为void，\n回调函数的执行是与TCP连接有关的，\n参数应该是TcpConnection对象\nusing Callback=std::function<void(TcpConectionPtr)>;"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZElz7yJEvRhE=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZElz7m5EIKhk="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZCDWACGFrjZc="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "464:606;454:855"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZEmBM2aHS5M0=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 304,
							"top": 960,
							"width": 329,
							"height": 89,
							"text": "5. TcpConnection对象可以作为函数参数吗？\n由于TcpConnection对象不能进行复制，\n要表达对象语义，所以不能直接作为\n函数参数存在，只能使用指针或者引用；\n而为了考虑对象的内存管理问题，需要使用智能指针"
						},
