							"left": 288,
							"top": 1064,
							"width": 360.1201171875,
							"height": 85,
							"text": "6. 在使用智能指针时，是用unique_ptr还是shared_ptr?\n如果使用unique_ptr，则在调用过程中，需要转移所有权，\n这样会导致内存管理出现问题；而使用shared_ptr之后，\n在传递参数时，只需要引用技术加1就可以传递了，很简洁\n也不会出现所有权的转移"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZEmUtv9XDJSY=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZEmUtjtWcj8w="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZCDWACGFrjZc="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "470:606;467:1063"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZEmn/bPAdv7A=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 600,
							"top": 888,
							"width": 485.841796875,
							"height": 55,
							"text": "7. 在handleNewConnection函数中要创建TcpConnection对象，\n并且需要设置三个回调函数,则需要一以数据成员的形式提前准备好3个函数对象；\n在handleMessage函数中如果发现连接断开，就要回收TcpConnection对象"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZEmn/m/BE1VE=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZEmn/bPAdv7A="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDY0HcIEfXHc="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "801:617;838:887"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZEmzpX/4djKI=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 640,
							"top": 952,
							"width": 437.2822265625,
							"height": 50,
							"text": "8.在管理TcpConnection对象的过程中，也需要使用智能指针shared_ptr\nusing TcpConnectionPtr=shared_ptr<TcpConnection>;"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZEmzpk/5Elh0=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZEmzpX/4djKI="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGZDY0HcIEfXHc="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "804:617;854:951"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGZEnMQqjFWJhE=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fe0000",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"left": 288,
							"top": 1160,
							"width": 305,
							"height": 55,
							"text": "7. 当确定好了函数对象之后，就需要通过\nsetAllCallbacks注册3个回调函数；\n当回调函数执行时，就调用handle系列函数"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
